Truck number one is the Nissan Titan.

61
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,059
In August of twenty twenty-three,

62
00:01:51,059 --> 00:01:53,822
a Nissan spokesman confirmed to Motor Authority

63
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:55,820
that the Titan would end after the

64
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:57,583
