91
00:02:40,091 --> 00:02:41,422
In twenty twenty-five,

92
00:02:41,422 --> 00:02:43,721
the Ford F-Series sold more than fifty

93
00:02:43,721 --> 00:02:45,717
times as many trucks as the Titan

94
00:02:45,717 --> 00:02:47,290
sold in twenty twenty-two.

95
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:49,945
Same country, same kind of buyer,

96
00:02:49,945 --> 00:02:51,370
