134
00:03:58,391 --> 00:04:02,485
Truck number two is the all-electric Ram

135
00:04:02,485 --> 00:04:03,406
1500 REV.

136
00:04:03,586 --> 00:04:04,786
On September twelfth,

137
00:04:04,786 --> 00:04:07,870
twenty twenty-five, Stellantis announced that it would

138
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:11,469
