142
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:20,853
A truck that people had been waiting

143
00:04:20,853 --> 00:04:22,915
years for was officially dead before a

144
00:04:22,915 --> 00:04:24,217
single customer got one.

145
00:04:24,567 --> 00:04:25,725
Look at the timeline,

146
00:04:25,725 --> 00:04:27,820
because it tells the story better than

147
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:28,537
