148
00:04:28,717 --> 00:04:31,151
The electric Ram debuted as a concept

149
00:04:31,151 --> 00:04:33,059
in early twenty twenty-three.

150
00:04:33,239 --> 00:04:35,503
Then the launch was pushed to twenty

151
00:04:35,503 --> 00:04:36,258
twenty-five.

152
00:04:36,438 --> 00:04:38,342
Then to early twenty twenty-six.

153
00:04:38,522 --> 00:04:40,623
Then to the middle of twenty twenty-seven.

