175
00:05:22,846 --> 00:05:25,151
trucks, which lets the company ease off.

176
00:05:25,331 --> 00:05:26,712
Think about what that means.

177
00:05:26,892 --> 00:05:28,843
A lot of the electric truck push

178
00:05:28,843 --> 00:05:31,098
