was scheduled to go on sale in

189
00:05:47,523 --> 00:05:50,966
twenty twenty-six, and Stellantis said it would

190
00:05:50,966 --> 00:05:53,017
be renamed the Ram 1500 REV.

191
00:05:53,197 --> 00:05:55,867
Same badge, completely different idea.

192
00:05:56,047 --> 00:05:58,107
The truck that was going to replace

