00:09:27,561 --> 00:09:29,815
Now watch what happens at the third

298
00:09:29,815 --> 00:09:31,554
big player, General Motors,

299
00:09:31,554 --> 00:09:33,614
because its story is not told by

300
00:09:33,614 --> 00:09:34,516
a sales chart.

301
00:09:34,696 --> 00:09:36,414
It is told by a factory.

302
00:09:36,764 --> 00:09:39,257
Truck number four is the GMC Hummer

303
00:09:39,257 --> 00:09:41,678
EV pickup, and its story is easier

304
00:09:41,678 --> 00:09:43,602
