305
00:09:43,602 --> 00:09:44,670
a sales report.

306
00:09:44,850 --> 00:09:45,841
The Hummer EV,

307
00:09:45,841 --> 00:09:47,610
along with the Sierra EV,

308
00:09:47,610 --> 00:09:50,654
the Chevrolet Silverado EV and the Cadillac

