00:09:50,654 --> 00:09:52,989
Escalade IQ, is built at a single

310
00:09:52,989 --> 00:09:55,891
General Motors plant called Factory Zero.

311
00:09:56,071 --> 00:09:57,669
It was built to be the home

312
00:09:57,669 --> 00:09:59,090
