326
00:10:23,412 --> 00:10:24,036
next week.

327
00:10:24,386 --> 00:10:25,674
Then came the pauses.

328
00:10:25,854 --> 00:10:28,871
From October twenty-seventh to November twenty-fourth,

329
00:10:28,871 --> 00:10:31,775
twenty twenty-five, the plant was temporarily idled.

330
00:10:31,955 --> 00:10:33,935
Then, according to the union,

331
00:10:33,935 --> 00:10:36,665
a second pause began on March sixteenth,

332
00:10:36,665 --> 00:10:39,874
with workers expected back on April thirteenth,

333
00:10:39,874 --> 00:10:41,034
about four weeks.

334
00:10:41,214 --> 00:10:43,885
The remaining thirteen hundred workers were placed

335
00:10:43,885 --> 00:10:44,953
on temporary layoff.

336
00:10:45,133 --> 00:10:47,061
That is two shutdowns in about five

337
00:10:47,061 --> 00:10:48,878
months at the plant built for the

338
00:10:48,878 --> 00:10:50,090
electric truck future.

339
00:10:50,441 --> 00:10:52,484
GM's explanation was short.

340
00:10:52,664 --> 00:10:55,892
A spokesperson said Factory Zero would temporarily

341
00:10:55,892 --> 00:10:59,378
