342
00:10:59,378 --> 00:11:00,605
with market demand.

343
00:11:00,785 --> 00:11:02,260
Read that sentence slowly.

344
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:04,339
The company is not saying the trucks

345
00:11:04,339 --> 00:11:04,762
are bad.

346
00:11:04,942 --> 00:11:06,632
It is saying there are more being

347
00:11:06,632 --> 00:11:08,169
built than people want to buy.

348
00:11:08,349 --> 00:11:09,817
And in the car business,

349
00:11:09,817 --> 00:11:12,141
that gap is the most expensive problem

350
00:11:12,141 --> 00:11:12,691
there is.

351
00:11:13,042 --> 00:11:14,667
Now, one honest note.

352
00:11:14,847 --> 00:11:16,971
None of the sources we used publish

353
00:11:16,971 --> 00:11:18,912
