359
00:11:25,764 --> 00:11:26,856
laid off workers,

360
00:11:26,856 --> 00:11:27,949
and paused twice.

361
00:11:28,129 --> 00:11:29,420
Those are decisions,

362
00:11:29,420 --> 00:11:30,195
