369
00:11:43,719 --> 00:11:45,930
and that is exactly the problem for

370
00:11:45,930 --> 00:11:46,625
its buyers.

371
00:11:46,805 --> 00:11:48,860
It is a very expensive truck in

372
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:51,709
a market where buyers are suddenly cautious

373
00:11:51,709 --> 00:11:53,830
about expensive electric trucks.

374
00:11:54,010 --> 00:11:56,495
Great engineering does not fix a demand

375
00:11:56,495 --> 00:11:57,005
problem.

376
00:11:57,185 --> 00:11:58,664
And the next truck on our list

377
00:11:58,664 --> 00:11:59,797
